      "value": "On vive-based control schemes (vive itself, windows mixed reality), this is possible with the Gesture parameter values set to 1. I agree that I would want to see this implemented as it would offer a universal parameter that works on all platforms as intended. Definitely would want this on desktop. Updooted.",
