  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-02-25T11:29:17.932Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be immensely useful if we had a parameter for when your vr controller trigger is being pulled, or when your mouse button is being clicked. Being able to fire guns or trigger other animations with an actual trigger pull would be a huge boon to immersion. (I know there is GestureWeightLeft/Right but that doesn't work on oculus controllers as the grip is used for that instead. Also not applicable to desktop users)",
